    "commit_message": "* chore: upgrade rollup dependency and use it for all packages\n\n* chore: migrate from Parcel to Vite for examples\n\n* chore(codemods): migrate from Parcel to Rollup build\n\n* chore(instantsearch.js): migrate all builds to Rollup\n\n* chore(examples): migrate React SSR example from Webpack to Vite\n\n* chore: remove obsolete babel preset and clean up yarn.lock\n\n* chore: add shared Rollup configuration utilities\n\n* chore: add Codacy config to exclude Rollup configs\n\n* chore(vue-instantsearch): fix aliasVueCompat plugin to correctly resolve vue-compat imports\n\n* chore(vue-instantsearch): use shared Rollup plugin utilities\n\n* chore: migrate build from Babel to SWC\n\n* chore: remove @rollup/rollup-darwin-arm64 dependency\n\n* chore(build): disable SWC external helpers\n\n* chore: improve extension resolver for ESM builds\n\n* chore: enable SWC external helpers\n\n* chore: preserve modules root for ESM output\n\n* chore(vue-instantsearch): mark @swc/helpers as external\n\n* chore: fix plugin order and commonjs handling\n\n* chore: support Storybook-specific Babel settings\n\n* chore: add `babel-preset-vue` dependency\n\n* chore(vue-instantsearch): scope Storybook babel-loader to algoliasearch\n\n* chore: add legacy file name option for UMD bundles\n\n* chore: update bundle size limits after build optimization\n\n* chore: update bundle size limits\n\n* chore: add CJS version of extension resolver plugin and add tests\n\n* chore: add plugin to wrap warnings with __DEV__ checks\n\n* chore: fix SWC JSX pragma collision with local vars\n\n* chore: pin baseline-browser-mapping to 2.9.19 to avoid warning\n\n* chore: fix examples\n\n* chore: share JSX pragma fix plugins across builds\n\n* chore: update bundle size limit\n\n* chore: exclude UMD example packages from TypeScript\n\n* chore: exclude example symlinks from linting and type checking\n\n* cleanup dependencies\n\n* output comparison\n\n* chore(build): preserve module structure and use all source entries as input\n\n- Enable preserveModules for react-instantsearch, react-instantsearch-core,\n  and instantsearch-ui-components to match the old Babel file-by-file output.\n  This fixes module identity issues where root imports and deep path imports\n  would resolve to different module instances.\n- Use collectSourceEntries() to walk all source files as rollup inputs\n  (instead of just index.ts), ensuring barrel and type-only files are emitted.\n- Disable sourcemaps across all build formats to match npm output.\n\n* chore: update bundle size limit\n\n* chore: update bundle size limit\n\n* bump\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Haroen Viaene <hello@haroen.me>",
