  "body": "## Summary\n\nThis PR unifies the build system across the entire monorepo by standardizing on **Rollup + SWC** for package builds and **Vite** for examples\n\nRelated: [FX-3692](https://algolia.atlassian.net/browse/FX-3692)\n\n## Changes\n\n### Build pipeline\n- Migrate transpilation from **Babel to SWC** for all packages\n- Simplify Babel config to **Jest/Storybook only**\n- Introduce shared Rollup configuration (`scripts/build/rollup.base.mjs`, `rollup.plugins.mjs`) to eliminate duplicated build logic across packages\n- Rewrite the Babel extension resolver as a Rollup plugin (`rollup-plugin-extension-resolver`) with CJS/ESM support and tests\n- Add a Rollup plugin to wrap warnings with `__DEV__` checks (replaces the Babel equivalent)\n- Add shared JSX pragma fix plugins and banner generation\n- Bump bundlesize thresholds slightly to reflect the new output (negligible deltas)\n\n### Package configs\n- Convert all package Rollup configs from `.js` to `.mjs` and refactor them to use the shared base config\n- Packages affected: `instantsearch.js`, `react-instantsearch`, `react-instantsearch-core`, `react-instantsearch-nextjs`, `react-instantsearch-router-nextjs`, `vue-instantsearch`, `algolia-experiences`, `algoliasearch-helper`, `instantsearch-ui-components`, `instantsearch-codemods`\n\n### Examples\n- Migrate all examples from **Parcel to Vite** (JS, React, Vue)\n- Migrate the React SSR example from **Webpack to Vite**\n- Add symlinks for UMD example local packages\n\n## Known issues\n\n- Vue SSR example is still not building\n\n## Breaking / Compatibility\n- IE11 compatibility unchanged (targets unchanged)\n- Build output filenames unchanged\n\n[FX-3692]: https://algolia.atlassian.net/browse/FX-3692?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ",
